policyDetails.content:
1. We generally collect your personal data where (a) it is provided to us voluntarily by you directly or via a third party who has been duly authorised by you to disclose your personal data to us (your "authorised representative") after you (or your authorised representative) have been notified of the purposes for which the data is collected, or (b) such collection, use or disclosure without consent is permitted or required under the Personal Data Protection Act 2012 of Singapore (PDPA) or other applicable laws. Where you voluntarily provide us with your personal data, you shall be deemed to have consented to our collection, use and disclosure of such personal data for the purposes notified to you and for purposes reasonably related to those purposes. We may also collect, use or disclose your personal data without further consent where permitted or authorised under the PDPA or other applicable laws.

2. We may collect and use your personal data for any or all of the following purposes:

2.1 performing obligations in the course of or in connection with our provision of the goods and/or services requested by you;
2.2 verifying your identity;
2.3 responding to, handling, and processing queries, requests, applications, complaints, and feedback from you;
2.4 managing your relationship with us;
2.5 processing payment or credit transactions;
2.6 complying with any applicable laws, regulations, codes of practice, guidelines, or rules, or assisting in law enforcement and investigations conducted by any governmental and/or regulatory authority;
2.7 sending you marketing, advertising, promotional and/or direct marketing communications relating to our products, services, promotions, events, campaigns or special offers (including those of our related corporations, partners or affiliates, where applicable) via email, SMS, telephone calls, WhatsApp messages and/or other messaging platforms, in accordance with the PDPA and other applicable laws. You may opt out of receiving such marketing communications at any time by following the unsubscribe instructions provided in the communication or by contacting us directly;
2.8 any other purposes for which you have provided the information;
2.9 transmitting to any unaffiliated third parties, including our third party service providers and agents, and relevant governmental and/or regulatory authorities, whether in Singapore or abroad, for the aforementioned purposes; and
2.10 any other incidental business purposes related to or in connection with the above.
